(ballistic-reentry-trace)
*title Named ballistic reentry trace with survey summaries
*method rk4-fixed
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*file ballistic_reentry_trace.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*trajectory 1 reentry_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=550 alt=300000 lat=0 long=0 vel=7200 gama=-20 psi=90
  *print time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt dynprs nx
  *segment 1 atmospheric-reentry
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.1
    *aero caxial=0.08
    *when alt<0 stop

*survey 1 entry_angle vals=-20,-25,-30
*survey 2 entry_speed lo=6500 hi=7500 inc=500
*summarize peak_dynamic_pressure decm=1
  add maxfit(dynprs[1])
*summarize peak_lateral_load decm=2
  add minfit(nx[1])
*end
